<div class="wikven-home-hero">
<div class="wikven-home-tagline">
<translate>
<!--T:1-->
Bake a wiki into a website.
</translate>
</div>
<div class="wikven-home-sub">
<translate>
<!--T:2-->
{{SITENAME}} renders your wikitext through [<tvar name="1">https://www.mediawiki.org/</tvar> MediaWiki] at build time and writes out
plain HTML. Nothing runs behind the published site.
</translate>
</div>
<div class="wikven-home-cta"><!--
-->{{home/route|Getting Started|primary}}<!--
-->{{home/route|Installation}}<!--
--></div>
</div>

<div class="wikven-home-section">
<translate>
<!--T:3-->
== How it works ==
</translate>
<div class="wikven-home-demo">
<syntaxhighlight lang="shell" copy>
mkdir src
echo 'Hello, World!' > src/index.wikitext
wikven build
</syntaxhighlight>
<div class="wikven-home-caption">
<translate>
<!--T:4-->
Every <code>.wikitext</code> file under <code>src/</code> comes out as a page under <code>dist/</code>.
</translate>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="wikven-home-section">
<translate>
<!--T:5-->
== What you get ==
</translate>
<div class="wikven-home-cards"><!--
--><div class="wikven-home-card">
<div class="wikven-home-card-title">
<translate>
<!--T:6-->
Templates, not copy-paste
</translate>
</div>
<div class="wikven-home-card-body">
<translate>
<!--T:7-->
[[<tvar name="1">Special:MyLanguage/Pages#Templates</tvar>|Templates]], parser functions and [[<tvar name="2">Special:MyLanguage/Lua modules</tvar>|Lua modules]], all resolved at build time.
</translate>
</div>
</div><!--
--><div class="wikven-home-card">
<div class="wikven-home-card-title">
