</div>
<div class="wikven-home-card-body">
<translate>
<!--T:9-->
[[<tvar name="1">Special:MyLanguage/Extensions</tvar>|Bundled]], or fetched from Git as the site builds. Ship several [[<tvar name="2">Special:MyLanguage/Skins</tvar>|skins]] and let the reader choose.
</translate>
</div>
</div><!--
--><div class="wikven-home-card">
<div class="wikven-home-card-title">
