<!--T:11-->
The [[<tvar name="1">Special:MyLanguage/Searching</tvar>|index]] is built with the site and runs in the reader's browser.
</translate>
</div>
</div><!--
--><div class="wikven-home-card">
<div class="wikven-home-card-title">
<translate>
<!--T:12-->
Every language you write in
</translate>
</div>
<div class="wikven-home-card-body">
<translate>
<!--T:13-->
[[<tvar name="1">Special:MyLanguage/Translating</tvar>|Each one]] comes out as its own set of pages.
